<para>Stored relative to the Unreal project directory in editor builds (e.g. &quot;Content/TryllStringStorages&quot;) and relative to the packaged game directory in shipping builds. <ref refid="class_u_tryll_runtime_settings_1ad24e6fc9811c134de92dc39fd4f86597" kindref="member">ResolveStorageDataFolderForServer()</ref> converts this to an absolute path before CreateSession sends it on the wire.</para>
