<para>Advisory. It lets the server initialise those engines&apos; backends at CreateSession rather than at first use; a model&apos;s engine always comes from the server&apos;s catalog, so nothing here gates a load. Empty when nothing is registered, which is legal and is exactly what a fresh project sends.</para>
